{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And it shall be righteousness for us.</b> Some say this hints at the reward for commandments in the World to Come. According to the plain sense, because of the way of righteousness we are obligated to keep His will, for He is our Master. The correct interpretation in my eyes: all the nations will see that we are righteous when we keep His commandments and His statutes, which are righteous, for so it is written:"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:37.626880354Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}